				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5212</guid>
				<title>SCP-5212</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5212</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5212&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containment site lead scientist:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr To██ ███&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special containment procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5212 is contained within the newly formed site-██, 2 miles from town centre, a large warehouse has been constructed around the house, with future inhabitants able to be moved to site-██ with little effort, there is no access to the inside of the facility besides the main entrance, security cameras have been set up around the house to monitor any movement. three armed personnel are to be on the site at all times, two have been stationed at the entrance as site security, the other is to make sure the front door of SCP-5212 stays closed. Station rotation is required.&lt;br /&gt;
the guard stationed by the front door is to alert researchers if SCP-5212-2 is seen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5212 is a late 20th-century house, in the small town of ██████, in Dallas Texas. The building is made of a brick outer wall covering most of the house and tall stone pillars holding up the veranda. The steps to the porch of the house are in disrepair, and the veranda above the porch is in the process of falling apart, with the wood rotting away. The door of the house is to be kept closed until an expedition is permitted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When a person enters SCP-5212 the dimensions of the inside walls change, in an attempt to make whoever entered, leave. The rooms of SCP-5212 are cluttered with random objects, balls, toys, things that would typically be found lost in a public park, along with textbooks covered in a strange handwritten dialect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5212-1 is the pocket dimension believed to be within the confines of the house, as the number of rooms in the house would far exceed the dimensions of the outside building. As with the constantly changing walls, the walls of SCP-5212-1 are made of an unrecognizable wood substance, impervious to any means of damage.&lt;br /&gt;
The only room come across more than once within SCP-5212-1 has an unlocked door that&#039;s being held shut by SCP-5212-2.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5212-2 is an unknown being inhabiting SCP-5212, very little is known about this being, but any attempts to contain or view it are unsuccessful, as its strength is far too great to overpower and open the door.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5212-1 is extremely hostile when provoked, prey will hear a slight tapping at first, which changes volume constantly, only to be consumed by an incredibly bright white light, any further methods of termination by SCP-5212-2 are unknown. the exact amount of inhabitants of SCP-5212 is unknown at this present moment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occasionally the door is heard opening by researchers outside of SCP-XXXX , but SCP-5212-2 is never seen roaming the house.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A staircase inside SCP-5212 is visible from the outside, but no such staircase exists within.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional notes:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5212 was discovered by the foundation when many residents of the town ██████ experienced random assaults from other residents who had entered and left scp-5212 earlier. All residents who left SCP-5212 were reported in saying “leave me alone” constantly as they attacked. The strange occurrences were picked up by Dr. To██ ███, who then set up a Provisional Containment site-██ around the reported property.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expeditions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Below are the expeditions within SCP-5212&lt;br /&gt;
All proceeding expeditions were approved by Dr. To██ ███.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5212-expedition-1&quot;&gt;SCP-5212 Expedition 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5212-expedition-2&quot;&gt;SCP-5212 Expedition 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5212-expedition-3&quot;&gt;SCP-5212 Expedition 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5212-expedition-4&quot;&gt;SCP-5212 Expedition 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351681&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 07 Dec 2020 10:44:26 +0000</pubDate>
