				<title>Interview Examination Questions 1</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-examination-questions-1</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BEGIN SURVEY]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655, what is your name?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; well…. Ahah, you can just call me the…. The Charismatic skull&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; Where is your place of origin?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; ahhh, where was the place? Alaska! Thats it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; what is the reason for your obsession with bones?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; the bones…… well, you can do a lot of things with bones, can&#039;t you? You can walk, point, and even break them!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; I repeat, what is the reason for your obsession with bones?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; a man with determination i see, good lad……. Well, I need suitable replacements for my bones, don&#039;t i?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a skeleton, made from the same substance as you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; of course I do, but don&#039;t try ahah, you won&#039;t find it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; how are you able to excrete your hypnosis when near personnel?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; my what?&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230; my hypnosis? You don&#039;t take me for a witch or something horrid like that do you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; how were you able to convince subject D-6542 to almost rip out his own flesh and bones for you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; he saw the truth, and he knew what the right thing to do was….. And not to toot my own horn ahah, but i&#039;m rather good at convincing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; are you able to move around only as a skull?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; now why would i say i could do something, without doing it first&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; And the final question for today, what is your end goal?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; aha, now why would i ever want to spoil something as hilarious as that!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; a conclusive answer is needed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; oh fine&amp;#8230;. well, bones! there we go, that&#039;s definitely my goal, is that good enough champ?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END SURVEY]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
