					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-final-log</guid>
				<title>Interview Report Final Log</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-final-log</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Documented Instance Of SCP-5655’s Weekly Phenomenon:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr B████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewee:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date/s:&lt;/strong&gt; 29/8/20██&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BEGIN LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;… I see, all of you…. Dr B, you will always disappoint me&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; hello scp-5655, my goal isn&#039;t to impress you, so your disappointment is only noted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; you should never disappoint your guest…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; noted, on more pressing matters, why have you been dormant for more than a month, and where, if anywhere, have you been.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;…. I watched all of you, especially you Dr B&amp;#8230;. and I waited.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; I thought your sentience was only during your phenomenon?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;… Aha it is&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; then how could you-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; NO MATTER, enough of that foolery, I think you have an idea of what I&#039;m pondering on now&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; uh, yes, we know what you want (away from mic) send in D-95714, and give him the remains of Dr Atlis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; uh, no wait, what did you just say champ?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; the bones are being sent in momentarily, have some patience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; oh. Well alright!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; hel… Hello scp-5655, I have uh, I have your bones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; aha you D class personnel are always good lads I-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;…. These bones, they&#039;re…. ahem, Mr D-95 whatever, I have another request for you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; I… I don&#039;t think I&#039;m allowed to do anything else…. I.. I&#039;m sorry&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; c&#039;mon lad, I&#039;m sure you don&#039;t want to disappoint your guest would ya?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;m just not….. No, no you make some good points, I… I think I&#039;m allowed to make one more request, surely&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; good… aha, now, I want you to take me out of this cell….. Bring me to Dr B, and give me his flesh, and bone…. ahem, did you get that champ?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; yes…. yes I did…. And It would be my honour to bring you what you need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; Subject D-95714 any action you take that is not a part of procedure will be considered hostile, and you will be promptly terminated, do you understand?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; NO!&amp;#8230;. I can&#039;t disappoint him, he… he knows what&#039;s best, and you&#039;re nothing but… but flesh and bone for him&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; I repeat, Subject D-95714 any action you take that is not a part of procedure will be considered hostile, and you will be promptly terminated, do you understand?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; No oh god no please don&#039;t do this, I can&#039;t disobey him…. He&#039;ll be disappointed in me! Please, please give him your flesh, he deserves it, he needs it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;…. Bring me to the cell door, now&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description of current events:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Subject D-95714 proceeds to remove scp-5655&#039;s glass casing and then lifts it up and cradles it in his arms, he keeps repeating the phrase &amp;quot;he deserves it, he deserves it&amp;quot; subject D-95714 then runs to the cell door and starts violently slamming his left arm on the door, so hard his arm begins breaking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; please let me out! Oh god please, I can&#039;t handle this…… he.. He needs your flesh doctor! Please, your bones too!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; use door code ████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject D-95714:&lt;/strong&gt; okay. okay I will..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description of current events:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
The containment cell door slides open with Subject D-95714 quickly sprinting out of the cell door, heading straight for Dr B, armed personnel are quick to respond, instantly shooting D-95714 in the cranium, with him dropping to the floor, and scp-5655 dropping with him. but with it falling directing facing Dr B.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#8230;.. You over there, pick it up, pick it up now. And put it back in that fucking containment cell now!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;…. You will never contain me Dr B…. never destroy me….. your research, never finished&amp;#8230;… and you all will never know why I was here…. Goodbye B████, I trust my time here was…….. entertaining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT ANY FURTHER COMMUNICATION WITH SCP-5655 IS TO BE REPORTED TO DR B████ EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post interview report&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
This is will likely be the final report on scp-5655, for while at least. the thing has stopped talking to us, and we believe it&#039;s attempt to escape was more a warning rather than an actual escape plan, but we may never know, research on scp-5655 will continue, but with no knew information many of our personnel may be reassigned to other anomalies, as scp-5655 may stay in its dormant state forever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signing off:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr B████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
