				<title>Interview Report Log 3</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-log-3</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Third Documented Instance Of SCP-5655’s Weekly Phenomenon:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr H█████ Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewee:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date/s:&lt;/strong&gt; 9/7/20██ 10/7/20██ 11/7/20██&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BEGIN LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; 9/7/20██ scp-5655 do you read me&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; 10/7/20██ scp-5655 do you read me&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; 11/7/20██ scp-5655 do you read me, this is doctor Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; I could hear you doctor, even in my dormant state I can hear…. all of you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; well, if you could hear me, why not respond?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;#8230;.. You must realise that your research… your facility, it isn&#039;t all i have, i have other matters to attend to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; you are under out supervision, if you leave we will pick up even the slightest movement in that cell, it isn&#039;t possible&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; oh you&#039;re fun mr doctor….. For a man of science you&#039;re rather slow aren&#039;t you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; excuse me? I didn&#039;t say a single false fact in that sentence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; not to fear! I think we have our own business to attend to, don&#039;t we&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; (away from microphone) send in subject D-6542’s remains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; ah! The lad from our last meeting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; we’re granting your request just this time, please note all your actions will be noted for future references&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; now of course, wouldn&#039;t want me trying anything….. Hostile, now would we?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description of current events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Scp-5655 then proceeds to grow long and thin fleshy tendrils from the bottom of the foramen magnum, it uses these tendrils to lift up the various pieces of subject D-6542’s skeleton, scp-5655 then appears to attach each bone together in a way only possible with muscle and nerve, it then begins to stand up and becomes almost instantly mobile with the temporary skeleton.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; now now, there&#039;s nothing to fear, this skeleton is weak and i&#039;ve purely done this for research purposes ahaha&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; how are you able to keep the bones together, there&#039;s not even anything in between them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; in good time doctor, in good time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; hmm well, are you willing to answer a few questions now that your request has been granted?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; oh please, go ahead…. H█████ Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; That name is classified, how did you….&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; other questions please doctor, you&#039;re disappointing here&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; okay…. Well, let&#039;s get started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-examination-questions-1&quot;&gt;Interview/examination questions 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; for final procedure we will need to dispose of your makeshift skeleton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-xxxx:&lt;/strong&gt; oh fine i&#039;ve already gotten what i want from this…. aha&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description of current events&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Doctor H█████ Atlis then proceeds to fire the incinerator inside of the containment cell, with it turning off 3 seconds after activation, scp-5655 is viewed to be on its stand, with not a single scorch mark on it, or its glass casing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post interview report&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
With the knowledge of what scp-5655 is able to do when presented with bones, we are now able to see that it is far more intelligent, and more dangerous then we first thought. I consider the examination survey to be a failure, as many of scp-5655’s answers seemed rushed, made up, or disingenuous, further surveys shall be taken.&lt;br /&gt;
A suspicion of scp-5655 learning from us has been almost completely proven right, with the gained knowledge of my name, higher ups in the SCP foundation have been informed of the possible intel security breach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signed:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr H█████ Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
