				<title>Interview Report Log 2</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-log-2</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Second documented instance of scp-5655’s weekly phenomenon:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr H█████ Atlis/ subject D-6542&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewee:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date:&lt;/strong&gt; 3/7/20██&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BEGIN LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Mister Doctor… can you hear me sir?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; we weren&#039;t expecting it to awake this early, i want the current readings of that room, now&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Ahah i was waiting for you, now now, shall we get to business?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; i guess it&#039;s speaking to me now&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Of course i am, we’re professionals after all, nevertheless i would like to get to the matter at hand&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; yes, I suppose we can (steps away from the mic) please escort subject D-6542 to the entrance of the containment cell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Oooo am I getting a visitor?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; yes, and I&#039;d prefer you to not attempt anything hostile towards the subject.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Well I can&#039;t make any promises, now can i lad? aha&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; (to armed personnel) i want you at that containment door ready for a quick extraction if it tries anything, copy that?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; bring him in, bring the boy in, i have a few requests for the champ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; (to control) Am i….. Am I supposed to talk to it?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; now, with introductions out of the way&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; but.. I didn&#039;t even say my na…..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; LET&#039;S get to business, i have a need for some bones, and i think you can assist me&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; Uh.. i&#039;m not sure if i&#039;m qualified to do that&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; hmmm… you don&#039;t seem to grasp the importance of this either, i would very much appreciate it if you could get the bones for me….. you don&#039;t want to make your guest unhappy, now would you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; but i don&#039;t know if….. No, wait, i understand, you NEED those bones, and i am the only one who can help you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; hehe.. There&#039;s a good lad, now make heist, you don&#039;t want to disappoint me.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; (to control) please… I need some bones, any bones… i can&#039;t leave him, he&#039;ll be disappointed in me… please&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; request denied, continue with the questions, as procedure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; but… but, NO please oh god no, i need to give him bones, please, he deserves it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; i repeat, request denied, continue with the questions, as procedure, or face termination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; if…. If i can&#039;t find any bones, then i&#039;m a failure…… and he’ll be angry with me, i….i have bones, he deserves my bones, he deserves all bones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; (to armed personnel) i want subject D-6542 escorted out of the containment cell and terminated effective immediately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-6542:&lt;/strong&gt; NO, please he needs them, get your fucking hands off me, you don&#039;t understand….. oh god no please, don&#039;t make me leave the cell&amp;#8230; please!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post interview report&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Scp-5655 is now being considered hostile with enough time, subject D-6542 was observed to be clawing and scratching at their own skin before termination, D-6542&#039;s remains shall be given to scp-xxxx as the next test we have for it. from what was documented scp-5655 uses weak hypnosis over its victims in order to use them for whatever needs scp-5655 requires, which is exclusively bones for the time being. Scp-5655 almost appears to sit and listen while other interactions are going on, i believe this is in attempt to learn, intent still unknown.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signed:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr H█████ Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
