					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Second documented instance of scp-5655’s weekly phenomenon:</strong></p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Dr H█████ Atlis/ subject D-6542</p> <p><strong>Interviewee:</strong> scp-5655</p> <p><strong>Date:</strong> 3/7/20██</p> <hr /> <blockquote> <p><strong>[BEGIN LOG]</strong></p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Mister Doctor… can you hear me sir?</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> we weren't expecting it to awake this early, i want the current readings of that room, now</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Ahah i was waiting for you, now now, shall we get to business?</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> i guess it's speaking to me now</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Of course i am, we’re professionals after all, nevertheless i would like to get to the matter at hand</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> yes, I suppose we can (steps away from the mic) please escort subject D-6542 to the entrance of the containment cell.</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Oooo am I getting a visitor?</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> yes, and I'd prefer you to not attempt anything hostile towards the subject.</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Well I can't make any promises, now can i lad? aha</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> (to armed personnel) i want you at that containment door ready for a quick extraction if it tries anything, copy that?</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> bring him in, bring the boy in, i have a few requests for the champ.</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> (to control) Am i….. Am I supposed to talk to it?</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> now, with introductions out of the way</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> but.. I didn't even say my na…..</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> LET'S get to business, i have a need for some bones, and i think you can assist me</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> Uh.. i'm not sure if i'm qualified to do that</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> hmmm… you don't seem to grasp the importance of this either, i would very much appreciate it if you could get the bones for me….. you don't want to make your guest unhappy, now would you?</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> but i don't know if….. No, wait, i understand, you NEED those bones, and i am the only one who can help you.</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> hehe.. There's a good lad, now make heist, you don't want to disappoint me.</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> (to control) please… I need some bones, any bones… i can't leave him, he'll be disappointed in me… please</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> request denied, continue with the questions, as procedure.</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> but… but, NO please oh god no, i need to give him bones, please, he deserves it!</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> i repeat, request denied, continue with the questions, as procedure, or face termination.</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> if…. If i can't find any bones, then i'm a failure…… and he’ll be angry with me, i….i have bones, he deserves my bones, he deserves all bones.</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> (to armed personnel) i want subject D-6542 escorted out of the containment cell and terminated effective immediately.</p> <p><strong>D-6542:</strong> NO, please he needs them, get your fucking hands off me, you don't understand….. oh god no please, don't make me leave the cell&#8230; please!</p> <p><strong>[END LOG]</strong></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p><strong>Post interview report</strong><br /> Scp-5655 is now being considered hostile with enough time, subject D-6542 was observed to be clawing and scratching at their own skin before termination, D-6542's remains shall be given to scp-xxxx as the next test we have for it. from what was documented scp-5655 uses weak hypnosis over its victims in order to use them for whatever needs scp-5655 requires, which is exclusively bones for the time being. Scp-5655 almost appears to sit and listen while other interactions are going on, i believe this is in attempt to learn, intent still unknown.</p> <p><strong>Signed:</strong> Dr H█████ Atlis</p> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684" alt="Sami Gibbons" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons" >Sami Gibbons</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
