				<title>Interview Report Log 1</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-log-1</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First Focumented Instance Of SCP-5655’s Weekly Phenomenon:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr H█████ Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewee:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date:&lt;/strong&gt; 23/6/20██&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BEGIN LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Uhh hello? Can any of you fancy chaps hear me? I know you, you right there can with your nicely pressed suit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; (through intercom) if you wouldn&#039;t mind me asking, how are you able to communicate with us? Only being a skull and all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; oh not to worry, that has no bearing on the situation at hand, i would like to speak to the headman of this fine establishment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; that would be me, yes (steps away from the mic) i want that full cell scanned and i want any possible reason its able to speak found&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; i can assure you sir, my comprehension of the queen&#039;s english is not strange, but we should really get to business Mr………?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; Doctor, Doctor Atlis, and what business are you referring to?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Finally! A man with qualifications, and the business I&#039;m referring to is that of bones, now you wouldn&#039;t happen to have any on hand, would you lad?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; You want bones? Do you mean human, or will any animal do?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh any will do Mr Doctor , i&#039;m not known for being picky.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; Hmmm, unfortunately i cannot grant your request at this time scp-5655, as more research is required to determine whether you’re a threat or not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; ahah but… uh Mr Doctor, you don&#039;t seem to fully understand the situation i see. But.. I must realise that this is our first meeting, and I&#039;m sure you don&#039;t want to leave a bad impression, I&#039;ll let it slide just this time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr Atlis:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh well thanks i guess, would you mind answering a few questions for us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post interview report&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The discovery of scp-5655’s sentience was a complete shock to everyone working on it, and being able to hold a conversation with it means it&#039;s intelligent of some sort, further testing required to determine exact intelligence. Scp-5655 seems to have a strange interest with bones of any sort. further testing s required to determine whether granting scp-5655&#039;s request is safe. unfortunately scp-5655 seemed to become dormant again before i was able to ask any questions, the sudden dormancy may be connected to not receiving any bones, further research required. End Report&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signed:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr H█████ Atlis&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
