					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-log-5</guid>
				<title>Interview Report Log 5</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/interview-report-log-5</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fifth documented instance of scp-5655’s weekly phenomenon:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewer:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr B████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interviewee:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date/s:&lt;/strong&gt; 22/7/20██&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[BEGIN LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; hello scp-5655, my name is Dr B, do you understand?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; i do hear you Dr B, but I&#039;d prefer to be talking to Dr Atlis if you&#039;d be so kind&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; unfortunately Dr Atlis has been disposed of, his failure to properly contain you and secure foundation files ultimately led to his resignation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; …… you know B████, killing Dr Atlis was your first mistake, but then lying straight to my face about him resigning was your second, and you should know, Dr Atlis didn&#039;t disappoint me, but you are, and that&#039;s no way to treat your guest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr Atlis’ report did state you preferred using real names, everything we have on you, I know, so don&#039;t attempt to try anything, or else your privileges will be shrunken even more, do you understand?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scp-5655:&lt;/strong&gt; ………..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655 do you hear me?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr B:&lt;/strong&gt; scp-5655 respond immediately!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[END LOG]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post interview report&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
With the ordered termination of Dr H Atlis directly from the 05 council, research on scp-5655 has been slowed down quite a substantial amount, and with scp-5655 only seeming to want to talk to Dr Atlis, were going to have to try another attempt at continuing our research, on a side note scp-5655 seemed far more aggressive and almost decayed looking once finding out about Dr Atlis, the change in visual evidence of it has been theorized to be connected to scp-5655’s hypnosis, and with its hostile dormant state.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signed:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr B████&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607351684&quot; alt=&quot;Sami Gibbons&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons&quot;  &gt;Sami Gibbons&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
